  "candidate_status": {
    "1": "Face patch B-R 47; plain forehead, one low band and one feather. The far flute-hand finger count remains uncertain in the enlarged crop. Independent exact-checksum review is recorded in art/reviews/visual-reviews.json; this chapter remains unapproved.",
    "2": "Krishna face/torso patches B-R 22 and 18; gopika face patches R-B 106, 50 and 65. Krishna is too small for confident forehead and low-band confirmation. Independent exact-checksum review is recorded in art/reviews/visual-reviews.json; this chapter remains unapproved.",
    "3": "No youthful Krishna appears. Gopika 3 and the infant face patches R-B 192 and 183; gopikas 1 and 2 measure 69 and 101. Independent exact-checksum review is recorded in art/reviews/visual-reviews.json; this chapter remains unapproved.",
    "4": "No youthful Krishna appears. Three fully clothed gopikas have face-patch medians R-B 99, 100 and 100; incomplete hair and jewelry details remain visible. Independent exact-checksum review is recorded in art/reviews/visual-reviews.json; this chapter remains unapproved.",
    "5": "No youthful Krishna appears. V002 remains selected after the one authorized additional repair attempt. In unselected v003, the broad U-shaped ornament remains at the neck/chest (about x760–930,y150–280) and the pearl strand remains at the hip/waist (about x640–875,y410–525), so the exchange still reads as an ordinary necklace plus waist strand and is not legible. V002 shows the same placement; no further S005 repair is authorized. Face-patch median R-B 104. Independent exact-checksum review is recorded in art/reviews/visual-reviews.json; this chapter remains unapproved.",
    "6": "No youthful Krishna appears. Fully clothed gopika approaches with a ritual pot; face-patch median R-B 50; connected hands and feet are visible. Independent exact-checksum review is recorded in art/reviews/visual-reviews.json; this chapter remains unapproved.",
    "7": "No youthful Krishna appears. Two distinct seated women have face-patch medians R-B 124 and 131. Independent exact-checksum review is recorded in art/reviews/visual-reviews.json; this chapter remains unapproved.",
    "8": "Krishna forehead appears plain and one feather is visible, but raised jeweled circlet with central crest replaces the single low band. Krishna face patch B-R 23; one gopika face patch R-B 130. Independent exact-checksum review is recorded in art/reviews/visual-reviews.json; this chapter remains unapproved.",
    "9": "V003 has a plain forehead, one low gold band and one upright feather; Krishna face patch B-R 47. Two gopika patches (R-B 149 and 160) and Bhattathiri (R-B 149) exceed the warm-brown target. Independent exact-checksum review is recorded in art/reviews/visual-reviews.json; this chapter remains unapproved."
  },
